msgstr "Erkannt"

msgid "Disable Comments or similar plugins"
msgstr "Disable Comments oder ähnliche Plugins"

msgid "Disable WordPress AI support through its native filter and hide/block the Connectors screen. Stored credentials and independent non-AI integrations remain intact. Independent plugin AI is outside this setting."
